---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import KleapForm from "../components/KleapForm";
---
<Base title="MM Simrigs | Turnkey Motorsport Simulators" description="Elite turnkey sim racing cockpits engineered in South Tyrol, calibrated with real GT telemetry and built for uncompromising performance.">
  <div class="site-shell">
    <header class="topbar">
      <a class="brand" href="/" aria-label="MM Simrigs home"><span>MM</span><b>SIMRIGS</b></a>
      <nav><a href="#engineering">Engineering</a><a href="#lineup">Lineup</a><a href="#experience">Turnkey Experience</a><a href="#inquiry">Bespoke</a></nav>
      <a class="nav-cta" href="#lineup">Explore the rigs <span>↗</span></a>
    </header>

    <main>
      <section class="hero">
        <img src="https://assets.kleap.io/108516/images/1790679297140-mm-simrig-hero" alt="MM Simrigs high-performance simulator cockpit" />
        <div class="hero-scrim"></div>
        <div class="hero-content">
          <p class="eyebrow">Engineered in South Tyrol / Built for the apex</p>
          <h1>From Virtual Grid<br /><em>to the Real Apex.</em></h1>
          <p class="hero-copy">Zero-compromise turnkey sim racing, calibrated by a Porsche Sports Cup Suisse Champion.</p>
          <a class="button button-red" href="#lineup">Explore the rigs <span>↓</span></a>
        </div>
        <div class="hero-index">01 <i></i> 04</div>
        <div class="hero-stamp">MM / PRECISION<br />MOTORSPORT SYSTEMS</div>
      </section>

      <section class="manifesto" id="engineering">
        <div class="section-label">01 / The engineering edge</div>
        <div class="manifesto-grid"><h2>Built like a race car.<br /><span>Not a toy.</span></h2><p>MM Simrigs bridges the gap between virtual racing and real motorsport. Every system starts with a zero-flex aluminum extrusion chassis and custom-machined structural brackets, then gets tuned until the data feels like the track.</p></div>
        <div class="edge-grid">
          <article><strong>01</strong><h3>Zero-flex chassis</h3><p>Heavy-duty aluminum extrusion and structural brackets designed for absolute rigidity under high torque.</p></article>
          <article><strong>02</strong><h3>Modular by design</h3><p>Our proprietary MM Modular Core Architecture is motion-ready, upgradeable, and built for the long race.</p></article>
          <article><strong>03</strong><h3>Telemetry calibrated</h3><p>Brake bite, steering force and ergonomics are matched to real GT car data in our South Tyrol workshop.</p></article>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="lineup lineup-dark" id="lineup">
        <div class="section-heading"><div><div class="section-label">02 / The lineup</div><h2>Choose your<br /><span>race program.</span></h2></div><p>Four turnkey systems. One uncompromising standard.</p></div>
        <div class="product-grid">
          <article class="product"><div class="product-visual"><img src="https://assets.kleap.io/108516/images/1790687687372-1_f95c844f-61e1-453b-8061-04bc49305781.webp" alt="MM Simrigs cockpit reference image for Clubsport" loading="lazy" /><span>Reference image</span></div><div class="product-body"><div class="product-no">01 / 04</div><h3>Clubsport</h3><p>High-end entry point for ambitious track day drivers.</p><div class="price">≈ €7,500</div><ul><li>Standalone premium ecosystem</li><li>Race-ready aluminum chassis</li><li>Turnkey PC and simulator setup</li></ul><a class="product-link" href="/customize#Clubsport">Configure Clubsport <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></article>
          <article class="product featured"><div class="product-visual"><img src="https://assets.kleap.io/108516/images/1790687670544-H1-1.webp" alt="MM Simrigs cockpit reference image for Sprint" loading="lazy" /><span>Reference image</span></div><div class="product-body"><div class="product-no">02 / 04 <b>MODULAR CORE</b></div><h3>Sprint</h3><p>Heavy-duty gateway to the modular ecosystem.</p><div class="price">≈ €12,000</div><ul><li>Motion-ready chassis</li><li>Upgradeable modular architecture</li><li>Turnkey PC and simulator setup</li></ul><a class="product-link" href="/customize#Sprint">Configure Sprint <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></article>
          <article class="product"><div class="product-visual"><img src="https://assets.kleap.io/108516/images/1790687660852-HX1.webp" alt="MM Simrigs cockpit reference image for Cup" loading="lazy" /><span>Reference image</span></div><div class="product-body"><div class="product-no">03 / 04 <b>MODULAR CORE</b></div><h3>Cup</h3><p>Professional-grade hardware for single-make cup racing.</p><div class="price">≈ €16,000–€18,000</div><ul><li>Telemetry-matched pedal feel</li><li>High-torque steering performance</li><li>Upgradeable modular architecture</li></ul><a class="product-link" href="/customize#Cup">Configure Cup <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></article>
          <article class="product flagship"><div class="product-visual"><img src="https://assets.kleap.io/108516/images/1790687632606-1.1.webp" alt="MM Simrigs cockpit reference image for GT" loading="lazy" /><span>Reference image</span></div><div class="product-body"><div class="product-no">04 / 04 <b>MODULAR CORE</b></div><h3>GT</h3><p>The zero-compromise flagship for endurance training.</p><div class="price">≈ €22,000</div><ul><li>Elite direct-drive performance</li><li>Motorsport-grade hydraulic pedals</li><li>Endurance-ready computing power</li></ul><a class="product-link" href="/customize#GT">Configure GT <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></article>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="experience" id="experience"><div class="section-label">03 / The turnkey experience</div><div class="experience-grid"><h2>Arrive.<br /><span>Assemble.</span><br />Attack.</h2><div class="experience-list"><div><b>01</b><h3>Software, already dialed in</h3><p>Your high-end PC arrives with requested simulators pre-installed and configured.</p></div><div><b>02</b><h3>The right feel, from day one</h3><p>Max calibrates force feedback slew rates and load-cell pedal bites against real-world setups.</p></div><div><b>03</b><h3>A dossier for your data</h3><p>Receive bespoke car setups and step-by-step game configurations inside your PC.</p></div><div><b>04</b><h3>EU delivery, your way</h3><p>Partially assembled shipping with detailed guides, or white-glove on-site installation on request.</p></div></div></div></section>

      <section class="heritage"><div class="section-label">04 / Founders & heritage</div><div class="heritage-grid"><p class="quote">“We do not simulate the feeling of racing. We engineer the conditions to find it.”</p><div><h2>Born on the<br /><span>starting grid.</span></h2><p>MM Simrigs was founded by Max Mutschlechner, a Porsche Sports Cup Suisse Champion, alongside two mechanical engineers. Their shared obsession is simple: bring the precision, tension and physical truth of a race car into every customer’s room.</p></div></div></section>

      <section class="start-scratch" id="inquiry"><div class="start-scratch-copy"><div class="section-label">06 / Bespoke engineering</div><h2>Start from<br /><span>scratch.</span></h2><p>No off-the-shelf compromises. Tell us what you want to build and our engineering team will shape the right simulator, finish, hardware and delivery experience around you.</p><a class="button glass-button" href="/request">Start your request <span>↗</span></a></div><div class="glass-panel"><span class="glass-kicker">CUSTOM BUILDS / RACE TEAMS / PRIVATE COLLECTIONS</span><strong>One brief.<br />Built precisely.</strong><p>For private clients, commercial sim centres and professional race teams.</p></div></section>

      <section class="purchase-panel legacy-purchase" id="checkout-clubsport"><div><div class="section-label">06 / Direct purchase</div><h2>Clubsport<br /><span>€7,500.</span></h2><p>Secure your turnkey Clubsport system with a direct purchase request. A member of the MM Simrigs team will confirm configuration, delivery and payment details.</p></div><div class="form-wrap"><KleapForm client:load formId="clubsport-purchase" title="Purchase Clubsport" fields={[{name:"name",label:"Name",type:"text",required:true},{name:"email",label:"Email",type:"email",required:true},{name:"configuration",label:"Configuration notes",type:"textarea",required:true}]} submitText="Continue to secure purchase" /></div></section><section class="purchase-panel legacy-purchase" id="reservation-sprint"><div><div class="section-label">07 / Build reservation</div><h2>Sprint<br /><span>€1,200 deposit.</span></h2><p>Reserve a Sprint build slot with a €1,200 deposit, applied to the final €12,000 system price.</p></div><div class="form-wrap"><KleapForm client:load formId="reserve-sprint" title="Reserve Sprint" fields={[{name:"name",label:"Name",type:"text",required:true},{name:"email",label:"Email",type:"email",required:true},{name:"deposit",label:"Deposit",type:"text",required:true},{name:"brief",label:"Build brief",type:"textarea",required:true}]} submitText="Continue with €1,200 deposit" /></div></section><section class="purchase-panel legacy-purchase" id="reservation-cup"><div><div class="section-label">08 / Build reservation</div><h2>Cup<br /><span>€1,600 deposit.</span></h2><p>Reserve a Cup build slot with a €1,600 deposit, applied to the final €16,000–€18,000 system price.</p></div><div class="form-wrap"><KleapForm client:load formId="reserve-cup" title="Reserve Cup" fields={[{name:"name",label:"Name",type:"text",required:true},{name:"email",label:"Email",type:"email",required:true},{name:"deposit",label:"Deposit",type:"text",required:true},{name:"brief",label:"Build brief",type:"textarea",required:true}]} submitText="Continue with €1,600 deposit" /></div></section><section class="purchase-panel legacy-purchase" id="reservation-gt"><div><div class="section-label">09 / Build reservation</div><h2>GT<br /><span>€2,200 deposit.</span></h2><p>Reserve a GT build slot with a €2,200 deposit, applied to the final €22,000 system price.</p></div><div class="form-wrap"><KleapForm client:load formId="reserve-gt" title="Reserve GT" fields={[{name:"name",label:"Name",type:"text",required:true},{name:"email",label:"Email",type:"email",required:true},{name:"deposit",label:"Deposit",type:"text",required:true},{name:"brief",label:"Build brief",type:"textarea",required:true}]} submitText="Continue with €2,200 deposit" /></div></section><section class="inquiry" id="inquiry"><div><div class="section-label">05 / Bespoke & white glove</div><h2>Build your<br /><span>advantage.</span></h2><p>For private collectors, commercial sim centers and race teams. Tell us how you intend to race and we will engineer the system around it.</p></div><div class="form-wrap"><KleapForm client:load formId="bespoke-inquiry" title="Request a bespoke build" fields={[{name:"name",label:"Name",type:"text",required:true},{name:"email",label:"Email",type:"email",required:true},{name:"project",label:"Tell us about your project",type:"textarea",required:true}]} submitText="Send inquiry" /></div></section>
    </main>

    <footer><a class="brand" href="/"><span>MM</span><b>SIMRIGS</b></a><p>Engineered in South Tyrol. Calibrated for the real apex.</p><small>© {new Date().getFullYear()} MM Simrigs</small></footer>
  </div>
  <style>
    @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Barlow+Condensed:wght@500;600;700;800&family=DM+Mono:wght@400;500&display=swap');
    :global(html){scroll-behavior:smooth}.site-shell{background:#090a0b;color:#e7e9e8;font-family:'DM Mono',monospace}.topbar{height:76px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:0 5vw;border-bottom:1px solid #272a2c;position:relative;z-index:3;background:#090a0bee}.brand{color:#f3f4f3;text-decoration:none;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;font-family:'Barlow Condensed',sans-serif;letter-spacing:.08em}.brand span{border:2px solid #50a9b9;padding:3px 5px;font-size:16px;font-weight:800}.brand b{font-size:20px}.topbar nav{display:flex;gap:28px}.topbar nav a,.nav-cta{color:#a8acab;text-decoration:none;font-size:10px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.08em}.topbar nav a:hover,.nav-cta{color:#f0f2f1}.nav-cta{border:1px solid #676b6d;padding:12px 15px}.nav-cta span,.button span,.product-link span{color:#50a9b9}.hero{min-height:calc(100vh - 76px);position:relative;display:flex;align-items:flex-end;overflow:hidden}.hero>img{position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;filter:contrast(1.1) saturate(.65)}.hero-scrim{position:absolute;inset:0;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#090a0bdd 0%,#090a0b99 48%,#090a0b22 100%),linear-gradient(0deg,#090a0b 0%,transparent 45%)}.hero-content{position:relative;padding:0 8vw 10vh;max-width:850px}.eyebrow,.section-label,.product-no{font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#a8acab}.eyebrow{color:#f0f2f1;margin-bottom:26px}.hero h1,h2,h3{font-family:'Barlow Condensed',sans-serif;text-transform:uppercase;line-height:.9;margin:0;letter-spacing:.01em}.hero h1{font-size:clamp(65px,10vw,150px);font-weight:700}.hero h1 em{font-style:normal;color:#f0f2f1}h2 span{font-style:normal;color:#50a9b9}.hero-copy{max-width:480px;color:#c5c9c8;line-height:1.7;margin:30px 0}.button{display:inline-flex;gap:30px;align-items:center;text-decoration:none;text-transform:uppercase;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.1em;padding:16px 20px}.button-red{background:#50a9b9;color:#fff}.hero-index,.hero-stamp{position:absolute;font-size:10px;color:#a8acab;letter-spacing:.12em}.hero-index{right:5vw;bottom:9vh}.hero-index i{display:inline-block;width:70px;border-top:1px solid #50a9b9;margin:0 12px 3px}.hero-stamp{right:5vw;top:9vh;line-height:1.6;text-align:right}.manifesto,.lineup,.experience,.heritage,.inquiry{padding:110px 8vw}.manifesto{background:#111315}.manifesto-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.4fr 1fr;gap:8vw;margin:40px 0 100px}.manifesto h2,.section-heading h2,.experience h2,.heritage h2,.inquiry h2{font-size:clamp(54px,7vw,105px)}.manifesto-grid p,.heritage-grid p,.inquiry p{color:#a8acab;line-height:1.8;font-size:13px;max-width:470px}.edge-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);border-top:1px solid #35393b}.edge-grid article{padding:24px 30px 0 0;border-right:1px solid #35393b}.edge-grid article+article{padding-left:30px}.edge-grid strong,.experience-list b{color:#50a9b9;font-size:11px}.edge-grid h3,.experience-list h3{font-size:25px;margin:35px 0 15px}.edge-grid p,.experience-list p{color:#a8acab;font-size:12px;line-height:1.7}.lineup{background:#d7dad8;color:#0b0c0d}.lineup .section-label,.lineup .section-heading p{color:#555b5c}.section-heading{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:end;margin-bottom:55px}.section-heading p{font-size:11px}.product-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);border-top:1px solid #929796;border-bottom:1px solid #929796}.product{padding:24px 24px 28px 0;min-height:390px;border-right:1px solid #929796;display:flex;flex-direction:column}.product+.product{padding-left:24px}.product:last-child{border-right:0}.product-no{color:#555b5c;display:flex;justify-content:space-between}.product-no b{font-size:8px;color:#50a9b9}.product h3{font-size:48px;margin:45px 0 12px}.product p{font-size:11px;line-height:1.6;color:#555b5c;min-height:48px}.price{font-size:17px;margin:22px 0}.product ul{padding:0;margin:0;list-style:none;font-size:10px;line-height:2;color:#555b5c}.product li:before{content:'— ';color:#50a9b9}.product-link{margin-top:auto;color:#0b0c0d;text-decoration:none;text-transform:uppercase;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.08em}.experience{background:#111315}.experience-grid,.heritage-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:10vw;margin-top:45px}.experience-list>div{border-top:1px solid #35393b;padding:20px 0;display:grid;grid-template-columns:45px 1fr}.experience-list h3{margin:0;font-size:23px}.experience-list p{grid-column:2;margin:9px 0}.heritage{background:#50a9b9;color:#fff}.heritage .section-label,.heritage-grid p{color:#b9dce2}.heritage-grid .quote{font-family:'Barlow Condensed',sans-serif;text-transform:uppercase;font-size:clamp(32px,4vw,65px);line-height:.98;color:#fff;max-width:560px}.heritage h2{font-size:clamp(55px,7vw,100px)}.heritage h2 span{color:#17191a}.heritage-grid div p{color:#b9dce2}.inquiry{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:10vw;background:#090a0b}.inquiry>div>p{margin-top:35px}.form-wrap{border-top:1px solid #35393b;padding-top:20px}.form-wrap :global(label){color:#a8acab!important}.form-wrap :global(input),.form-wrap :global(textarea){background:#111315!important;border:1px solid #35393b!important;color:#fff!important;border-radius:0!important}.form-wrap :global(button){background:#50a9b9!important;border-radius:0!important}.form-wrap :global(form){max-width:none!important}footer{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:35px 8vw;border-top:1px solid #272a2c;color:#a8acab}footer p,footer small{font-size:10px}@media(max-width:800px){.topbar{padding:0 5vw}.topbar nav{display:none}.nav-cta{padding:10px;font-size:9px}.hero h1{font-size:70px}.hero-content{padding:0 5vw 12vh}.manifesto,.lineup,.experience,.heritage,.inquiry{padding:75px 5vw}.manifesto-grid,.experience-grid,.heritage-grid,.inquiry{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:45px}.edge-grid,.product-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}.edge-grid article{border-bottom:1px solid #35393b;padding:25px 10px 25px 0}.edge-grid article+article{padding-left:10px}.product{border-bottom:1px solid #929796;min-height:360px}.product:nth-child(2){border-right:0}.product:nth-child(3){padding-left:0}.section-heading{display:block}.section-heading p{margin-top:25px}footer{display:block}footer p{margin:24px 0}.hero-stamp{display:none}}
        .lineup-dark{background:#111516;border-top:1px solid #242b2d;border-bottom:1px solid #242b2d}.lineup-dark .section-heading h2,.lineup-dark .section-heading p{color:#eff5f5}.lineup-dark .product-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr));gap:14px;perspective:1400px}.lineup-dark .product{padding:0;background:#1b2224;border:1px solid #344246;color:#ecf2f2;display:flex;flex-direction:column;min-width:0;overflow:hidden;transition:transform .35s ease,border-color .35s ease,box-shadow .35s ease;transform-style:preserve-3d}.lineup-dark .product:hover{transform:translateY(-8px) rotateX(2deg);border-color:#50a9b9;box-shadow:0 18px 40px #0008}.lineup-dark .product-visual{height:190px;position:relative;overflow:hidden;background:#202c30}.lineup-dark .product-visual::after{content:"";position:absolute;inset:0;background:#50a9b9;mix-blend-mode:color;opacity:0;transition:opacity .35s}.lineup-dark .product:hover .product-visual::after{opacity:.75}.lineup-dark .product-visual img{display:block;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;object-position:center;filter:grayscale(.65);transition:transform .5s}.lineup-dark .product:hover .product-visual img{transform:scale(1.07)}.lineup-dark .product-visual span{position:absolute;z-index:1;bottom:10px;left:12px;background:#101719d9;padding:5px 7px;color:#d7e4e6;font-size:9px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.08em}.lineup-dark .product-body{padding:22px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;flex:1}.lineup-dark .product h3{color:#f4f8f8}.lineup-dark .product p,.lineup-dark .product li{color:#c6d0d1}.lineup-dark .product .price{color:#f4f8f8}.lineup-dark .product ul{margin-bottom:24px}.lineup-dark .product-link{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;width:100%;margin-top:auto;padding:14px 16px;background:#50a9b9;border:1px solid #50a9b9;color:#081315;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.04em;transition:background .2s,color .2s}.lineup-dark .product-link span{color:inherit}.lineup-dark .product-link:hover,.lineup-dark .product-link:focus-visible{background:#d8f2f5;color:#081315}.lineup-dark .product-link:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #fff;outline-offset:3px}@supports (animation-timeline:view()){.lineup-dark .product-visual img{animation:rig-drift linear both;animation-timeline:view();animation-range:entry 0% exit 100%}@keyframes rig-drift{from{object-position:center 20%}to{object-position:center 80%}}}@media(max-width:1100px){.lineup-dark .product-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}}@media(max-width:600px){.lineup-dark .product-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.lineup-dark .product-visual{height:220px}}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.lineup-dark .product,.lineup-dark .product-visual img{transition:none;animation:none}.lineup-dark .product:hover{transform:none}}
    .start-scratch{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.15fr .85fr;gap:7vw;padding:11vw 8vw;background:radial-gradient(circle at 18% 30%,#18383d 0%,transparent 34%),#0b1112;border-top:1px solid #263b3e;position:relative;overflow:hidden}.start-scratch::before{content:"";position:absolute;width:42vw;height:42vw;border:1px solid #50a9b933;border-radius:50%;right:-14vw;top:-12vw;transform:rotate(18deg)}.start-scratch-copy,.glass-panel{position:relative;z-index:1}.start-scratch h2{font-size:clamp(60px,8vw,120px);margin:14px 0 28px}.start-scratch p{max-width:520px;color:#b8c8ca;line-height:1.8}.glass-button{margin-top:20px;background:#50a9b9;color:#081315;border:1px solid #8edbe4;font-weight:700}.glass-panel{align-self:center;padding:42px;border:1px solid #b9f5ff45;border-radius:24px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#ffffff16,#8bdce30a);box-shadow:inset 0 1px #ffffff26,0 30px 80px #0007;backdrop-filter:blur(18px);transform:perspective(900px) rotateY(-8deg);transition:transform .4s ease}.glass-panel:hover{transform:perspective(900px) rotateY(0) translateY(-8px)}.glass-kicker{display:block;color:#50a9b9;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.14em;line-height:1.7;margin-bottom:40px}.glass-panel strong{font-family:'Barlow Condensed',sans-serif;text-transform:uppercase;font-size:clamp(38px,5vw,72px);line-height:.9;display:block}.glass-panel p{font-size:12px;margin-top:28px}.legacy-purchase{display:none!important}@media(max-width:900px){.start-scratch{grid-template-columns:1fr;padding:20vw 7vw}.glass-panel{transform:none}}
  </style>
  <style>
    .site-shell{background:#07090a;overflow:hidden}
    .topbar{background:rgba(7,9,10,.72);backdrop-filter:blur(22px);border-bottom-color:rgba(255,255,255,.12);position:sticky;top:0}
    .topbar nav a{transition:color .2s ease}
    .topbar nav a:hover{color:#50a9b9}
    .hero{min-height:calc(100vh - 76px);isolation:isolate}
    .hero::before{content:"";position:absolute;z-index:1;inset:auto 7vw 8vh auto;width:180px;height:180px;border:1px solid rgba(80,169,185,.38);border-radius:50%;box-shadow:0 0 80px rgba(80,169,185,.2);pointer-events:none}
    .hero-content{z-index:2;max-width:920px}
    .hero h1{max-width:820px;letter-spacing:-.03em;text-shadow:0 12px 40px rgba(0,0,0,.45)}
    .hero-copy{font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;max-width:560px}
    .button{border-radius:999px;box-shadow:0 12px 28px rgba(0,0,0,.24);transition:transform .25s ease,box-shadow .25s ease}
    .button:hover{transform:translateY(-3px);box-shadow:0 18px 34px rgba(80,169,185,.25)}
    .manifesto,.experience,.heritage{position:relative;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#0c1011,#101718 55%,#0a0d0e);overflow:hidden}
    .manifesto::before,.experience::before,.heritage::before{content:"";position:absolute;width:36vw;height:36vw;border:1px solid rgba(80,169,185,.12);border-radius:50%;right:-12vw;top:-13vw;pointer-events:none}
    .manifesto::after{content:"";position:absolute;inset:-18%;pointer-events:none;background:radial-gradient(circle at 24% 32%,rgba(80,169,185,.12),transparent 24%),radial-gradient(circle at 76% 72%,rgba(53,91,116,.1),transparent 28%);filter:blur(34px);transform:translate3d(var(--parallax-x,0px),var(--parallax-y,0px),0);transition:transform .18s ease-out;will-change:transform}
